sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Operator as Robot Operator / Systemd
    participant Core as EON Core Daemon (eond)
    participant Watchdog as Systemd Watchdog
    participant Shm as /dev/shm Ring Buffer
    participant Context as Encrypted SQLite (context.db)
    participant Engines as Seven Intelligence Engines
    participant ROS2 as eon_ros2_bridge

    %% Startup Sequence
    Note over Operator,ROS2: PHASE 1: DETERMINISTIC SYSTEM STARTUP
    Operator->>Core: systemd start eon.service
    activate Core
    Core->>Core: Load configuration & verify permissions (0660)
    Core->>Shm: Allocate POSIX SHM ring buffers
    Core->>Context: Open context.db & unwrap DEKs via TPM/KEK
    Core->>Engines: Initialize 7 Engines (DISCOVERED -> INITIALIZING -> INITIALIZED)
    Engines-->>Core: All engines successfully initialized
    Core->>Engines: Transition(RUNNING)
    Core->>Watchdog: sd_notify("READY=1") & Start 2.0s Heartbeat
    Core->>ROS2: Open UDS IPC Socket (/var/run/eon/eon.sock)
    ROS2->>Core: Connect() & Lifecycle Node on_configure() -> on_activate()
    Note over Core,ROS2: EON SYSTEM OPERATIONAL (ACTIVE)

    %% Shutdown Sequence
    Note over Operator,ROS2: PHASE 2: DETERMINISTIC CLEAN SHUTDOWN
    Operator->>Core: systemd stop eon.service (SIGTERM)
    Core->>ROS2: Publish Lifecycle State: STOPPING
    ROS2->>ROS2: on_deactivate() -> Cease publishing proposals (neutral posture)
    Core->>Engines: Command Transition(STOPPING -> STOPPED)
    Engines->>Engines: Drain active inference queues & unload models
    Engines-->>Core: Engines stopped confirmation
    Core->>Context: PRAGMA wal_checkpoint(PASSIVE) & Close database
    Core->>Shm: Unmap & unlink /dev/shm segments
    Core->>Watchdog: sd_notify("STOPPING=1")
    Core->>Core: Close IPC Unix domain socket
    Core-->>Operator: Process exit(0)
    deactivate Core
